	(text "Note: A001.4 & .6 appear\nto be inverted vs .5 & .7\nwhen looking physically\nwhere their outputs are tapped.\n\nHowever, downstream logic\nseems to want all of them +.\n\nThis leaves the possibility of\ninverted inputs on the gates\nwhere they are received."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 298.196 73.914 0)
		(effects
